{"availability":"available","full":"lowqen/RapfiWeb","name":"RapfiWeb","description":"Championship-level Gomoku & Renju AI in your browser: the Rapfi engine as multi-threaded WebAssembly, with game review, opening explorer and offline storage. No server.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-30T14:46:31Z","updated":"2026-10-11T21:13:51Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://rapfiweb.pages.dev","topics":["board-game","cloudflare-pages","emscripten","five-in-a-row","game-ai","gobang","gomoku","rapfi","react","renju","typescript","vite","wasm","web-worker","webassembly"],"demo":"https://rapfiweb.pages.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:49.267Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:49.267Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:49.267Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T19:04:00.533Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T17:58:49.267Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A championship-level Gomoku & Renju engine running entirely in your browser.","Play, analyze, review and research. No server, no install, no account.","Rapfi is one of the strongest open-source Gomoku/Renju engines, a C++ engine with NNUE evaluation. RapfiWeb compiles it to WebAssembly and wraps it in a full analysis workbench. A desktop GUI, an Android app and a server farm, all inside one browser tab."],"features":["Nothing leaves your device. Games, reviews, databases and statistics live in IndexedDB.","Works anywhere static files can be hosted. No backend, no API keys, no telemetry.","Fast. Multi-threaded SIMD search, 20 MB of network weights cached after the first visit.","Rapfi compiled with Emscripten into four variants: {single, multi}-thread × {SIMD128, Relaxed SIMD}.","The app probes the browser and boots the fastest one, falling back step by step."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lowqen/RapfiWeb/blob/main/README.md","